      "refersTo": "panel",
      "description": "A flat container whose heading introduces operational content.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-panel\"><div class=\"ds-section-heading\"><div><h2>Necesită atenție</h2><p>Deschide clientul pentru istoricul și estimarea alertelor.</p></div><a href=\"#cases\">Toate cazurile active</a></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-panel{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;border:1px solid var(--line,#e2e8f1);border-radius:var(--radius,12px);background:#fff;margin-bottom:24px;overflow:hidden;color:var(--ink,#172641)}.ds-section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:23px 24px 18px}.ds-section-heading h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.4;letter-spacing:-.015em;font-weight:650;margin:0 0 4px}.ds-section-heading p{color:var(--muted,#627087);font-size:12px;margin:0;max-width:72ch}.ds-section-heading>a{font-size:12px;white-space:nowrap;color:var(--blue,#2259da);text-decoration:none;text-underline-offset:3px}.ds-section-heading>a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-section-heading>a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #83a6ff;outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-section-heading{padding:20px 18px;flex-wrap:wrap}}"
    },
