      "html": "<details class=\"ds-disclosure\"><summary>Rezultate detaliate și validare</summary><div class=\"ds-disclosure-body\"><p>Simulările manuale fără etichetă sunt excluse din aceste rezultate.</p></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-disclosure{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line,#e2e8f1);margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--ink,#172641)}.ds-disclosure summary{color:var(--ink,#172641);cursor:pointer;padding:18px 0;font-size:13px;font-weight:550}.ds-disclosure summary::marker{color:var(--blue,#2259da)}.ds-disclosure summary:hover{color:var(--blue,#2259da)}.ds-disclosure summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #83a6ff;outline-offset:3px;}.ds-disclosure-body{padding:7px 0 24px}.ds-disclosure-body p{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 1em;color:var(--muted,#627087);max-width:72ch}"
